    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550100/extras/d10a23cfecd535fa8c2cb196f98799f3.avif?t=1658153853\" /></div><br><br>You are a demon hunter. That's your job. What do you say when your boss asks you to kill demons in a haunted tower? You say <i>yes</i>.<br>You've done this countless times, killing demons isn't something new. But this tower is <i>different</i>.<br>Your boss is uneasy, she regrets telling you about this tower. She says you don't need to go.<br><br>It's too late now. You always say <i>yes</i>, even when you really want to say <i>no</i>.<br><br>You go to the tower, takes the first step in. Everything goes dark. You don't know what happened. You don't know where you are.<br><br>All you know is that you will get out of the tower.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced combat<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels<br></li><li> Two different game modes: Classic and Survival<br></li><li> 80 items<br></li><li> 5 melee weapons<br></li><li> 10 ranged weapons<br></li><li> 14 bosses</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550100/extras/d10a23cfecd535fa8c2cb196f98799f3.avif?t=1658153853\" /></div><br><br>You are a demon hunter. That's your job. What do you say when your boss asks you to kill demons in a haunted tower? You say <i>yes</i>.<br>You've done this countless times, killing demons isn't something new. But this tower is <i>different</i>.<br>Your boss is uneasy, she regrets telling you about this tower. She says you don't need to go.<br><br>It's too late now. You always say <i>yes</i>, even when you really want to say <i>no</i>.<br><br>You go to the tower, takes the first step in. Everything goes dark. You don't know what happened. You don't know where you are.<br><br>All you know is that you will get out of the tower.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced combat<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels<br></li><li> Two different game modes: Classic and Survival<br></li><li> 80 items<br></li><li> 5 melee weapons<br></li><li> 10 ranged weapons<br></li><li> 14 bosses</li></ul>",
